{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29126","headline":"詶钱汝州 · 许浑","name":"詶钱汝州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白雪多随汉水流，谩劳旌斾晚悠悠。\n笙歌暗写终年恨，台榭潜消尽日忧。\n鸟散落花人自醉，马嘶芳草客先愁。\n怪来雅韵清无敌，三十六峰当庾楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29126.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29126","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}